        <mxCell id="n206" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="Como preencher:&#xa;&#xa;1. As classes de borda roxa ja estao posicionadas e ligadas.&#xa;2. Troque as linhas (preencher atributos) e (preencher operacoes) pelo conteudo real.&#xa;3. Evite mover as caixas: as dependencias dos servicos ja apontam para elas." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="360" x="-32" y="792" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n207" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="Ajustes sobre a versao anterior:&#xa;&#xa;1. finishStream devolve RecordingHandle (a gravacao e assincrona).&#xa;2. MediaProcessingService persiste via ContentRepository.&#xa;3. ClipService reage ao evento RecordingAvailable em vez de fazer polling.&#xa;4. PlaybackService depende de ContentRepository e do manifesto." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="250" width="360" x="-32" y="1052" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n208" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=16;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" value="Legenda:&#xa;&#xa;Laranja - servicos do dominio&#xa;Cinza - interfaces e contratos&#xa;Azul - value objects, eventos e enums (entradas e saidas)&#xa;Branco com borda roxa - classes a preencher&#xa;Seta tracejada - dependencia (use / create)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="200" width="360" x="-32" y="1332" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
